 nd the captain of the yacht face down in the water! As conditions worsen\,
  you must escape the yacht and solve the captain's murder.Registration for
  Teen Sleuths: Sabotage on the High Seas will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\
 , July 22nd for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednes
 day\, July 29th for residents of other municipalities.This program is for 
 teens ages 13-18 years only.Library Program PoliciesNo Show – Patrons fa
 iling to cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs in a m
 onth will be restricted from registering for future programs for a period 
