DESCRIPTION:Community\, Gaming\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nGo from "What's a Bam
 ?" to "Mahjong!" in this five-week intensive designed for true beginners. 
 We’ll dive into the tiles\, the National Mah Jongg League card\, and the
  fast-paced strategy that makes the game a total blast. By the final week\
 , you’ll be playing with confidence and style!The Full-Table Commitment:
  Because each lesson builds directly on the last\, signing up for the firs
 t session means you are committed to the full five-week journey. Please en
 sure you can attend every class before registering!Schedule (6-7:45pm):Mon
 day\, August 3Monday\, August 10Monday\, August 17Monday\, August 24Monday
 \, August 31New Players Only\, Please!: To keep things fair and give every
 one a shot at the tiles\, this course is strictly for true beginners. If y
 ou've already taken a Mahjong class at any library branch in the county\, 
 we ask that you leave this spot open for someone who hasn't had the chance
  to learn yet. We love your enthusiasm\, but this specific table is reserv
 ed for those who are brand new to the game!
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center C
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/mahjong-101-193809
