 understanding as we work to provide equitable access to this popular progr
 am.Get ready to brawl! Join us for an epic Super Smash Bros. Ultimate Tour
 nament on the Nintendo Switch\, where teens battle it out for bragging rig
 hts and prizes. Whether you're a seasoned fighter or a casual button-mashe
 r\, this tournament is open to all skill levels. Come solo or bring your c
 rew—only one will be crowned Smash Champion!We’ll kick things off with
  warm-up rounds\, then dive into a bracket-style tournament with 1v1 match
 es on the big screen. Between matches\, enjoy snacks\, cheer on your frien
 ds\, and hang out in a chill\, gamer-friendly space.Registration for Tween
  Video Gaming: Super Smash Bros. will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 2
