  flip books\, as well as learn the basics of animation. Ed has drawn for T
 he Walt Disney Company\, Warner Bros. Studios\, Don Bluth Animation Studio
 s\, Hanna Barbera Studios\, Hyperion Studios\, Filmation Studios\, Ross Ba
 gdasarian Productions\, Calabash Animation Studios\, K.C.M.P. Productions\
 , and numerous independent and commercial studios in New York and througho
 ut the country. This program is for adults. Registration Required.
