SUMMARY:Parachute Play
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260807T101500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260807T104500
UID:0d4454750ae670e4f8a0b30d99041067@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nJoin us for a cooperative m
 ovement program where we will use our imaginations while we play with a pa
 rachute! Stories and songs will be incorporated\, while we move about and 
 use our motor skills. A great activity for young children and their adults
  to come together and share an exciting and engaging play experience! (For
  safety reasons\, children must not be younger than 18 months or older tha
 n 3 years old with an adult\, adult involvement is required)Adults attendi
 ng with their child(ren) do NOT need to register. Please add any additiona
 l registrants to your registration if more than one child that will be par
 ticipating in the program.Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, 
 July 22nd for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\,
  July 24th for residents of other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesNo Show
  – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 library 
 programs in a month will be restricted from registering for future program
 s for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at 
 least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for those on the 
 waiting list to be notified of their change in registration status.Late Ar
 rivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to a
 llow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin promptly 
 at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to thos
 e on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrant
 s may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not be permi
 tted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Accompanying Adult
 s – This program is for adults and children to enjoy together. Please pl
 an to attend and be engaged with your child. Drop offs will not be permitt
 ed.Program Limits - Patrons are limited to one session of multiple session
  programs per week.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/parachute-play-154621
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
