SUMMARY:Ridiculous Nicholas Super Science Show
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260807T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260807T143000
UID:9067e70a2a7564b5701d378e399e4514@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Toddlers\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens\n\nGet r
 eady to laugh and learn with the one and only Ridiculous Nicholas! This hi
 gh-energy\, hilarious science show is packed with wild experiments\, amazi
 ng demonstrations\, and non-stop fun.Ridiculous Nicholas brings science to
  life with outrageous antics\, surprising facts\, and plenty of audience p
 articipation. From crazy chemical reactions to mind-blowing physics tricks
 \, this show will keep kids (and grown-ups!) on the edge of their seats—
 and maybe rolling on the floor with laughter!It’s silly. It’s smart. I
 t’s science like you’ve never seen it before. Perfect for families and
  children of all ages!*For the safety and supervision of all participants:
  Children under 8 years old must be accompanied by an adult throughout the
  program. Children ages 8 and older are welcome to attend the program inde
 pendently.  Registration for Ridiculous Nicholas Super Science Show will o
 pen at9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 22nd for Manheim Township and East Lampet
 er residents and on Wednesday\, July 29th for residents of other municipal
 ities.Registration Requirements – To help us manage our space\, please r
 egister every person who will be attending\, including adults or siblings.
 Cancellations- Please check your email prior to departing to verify that t
 he program has not been cancelled. Library Program PoliciesNo Show – Pat
 rons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs
  in a month will be restricted from registering for future programs for a 
 period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 
 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for those on the waiting 
 list to be notified of their change in registration status.Late Arrivals 
 – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow fo
 r parking and other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the 
 designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on th
 e wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may b
 e allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to
  enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Photography - The Manheim
  Township Public Library Code of Conduct Policy prohibits photographing or
  video recording individuals (including children) without their consent (o
 r in the case of a child\, the consent of a parent or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center ABC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/ridiculous-nicholas-supe
 r-science-show-161045
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
