BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/dungeons-and-dragons-adventure-club-kids-ages-9-12-only-2-168864"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Dungeons and Dragons Adventure Club for Kids (Ages 9-12 only)
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260812T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260812T183000
UID:c1399452345eda9584a0f9eefa62b317@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Children\, Tweens\n\nTo ensure fair access for as man
 y families as possible\, please read the registration guidelines for this 
 program.One Session Per Month: Patrons may register for only one session o
 f this program per month.Duplicate Registrations: Registrations for more t
 han one session in the same month will be cancelled.We appreciate your und
 erstanding as we work to provide equitable access to this popular program.
 Calling all young adventurers ages 9 to 12! Join us for an exciting journe
 y into the world of Dungeons & Dragons\, where your imagination sets the c
 ourse. Together\, we’ll learn how to create unique characters\, navigate
  magical lands\, and solve thrilling quests. No prior experience is needed
 —new and experienced players alike are welcome!In each session\, you'll 
 explore stories full of mystery\, monsters\, and more all while working as
  a team to overcome challenges and puzzles. Whether you're a brave warrior
 \, a clever wizard\, or a sneaky rogue\, there’s always an adventure wai
 ting. Are you ready to roll the dice and discover where the story leads?Sp
 aces are limited\, so sign up today to secure your spot in our grand adven
 ture! All materials will be provided.Registration will open at 9:00AM on W
 ednesday\, July 29th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and 
 on Wednesday\, August 5th for residents of other municipalities.LIBRARY PR
 OGRAM POLICIES:Drop Off Program – This program is intended for children 
 over the age of 9 years who can participate independently. Adult(s) must b
 e present to check in child with youth services staff prior to program. Ad
 ults will not be allowed in the event space. Designated Ages – Please ad
 here to the age restrictions designated on your registration. Only childre
 n in that age range will be admitted.Registration Requirements – To help
  us manage our space\, please register every person who will be attending\
 , including siblings.No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registrat
 ion for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from re
 gistering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please c
 ancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the progra
 m to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in
  registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to t
 he start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The 
 program will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your sp
 ot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. 
 If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, r
 egistrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the s
 tart time.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Study Room #119
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/dungeons-and-dragons-adv
 enture-club-kids-ages-9-12-only-2-168864
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/kids-garden-club-177381"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Kids' Garden Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260812T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260812T174500
UID:00b49ba5efe3bbe4ca37c867f2de8408@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Children\n\nSummer is here - our planters need our
  attention!  Join us on our patio for our exciting garden time!  (Rain or 
 shine - if it's raining\, we'll be meeting indoors and limit our outside t
 ime.)  We'll get our hands dirty in the planters\, do some crafts\, and ma
 ybe even read a story!  We'll supply\, the tools\, gloves\, and the plante
 rs.  Plan on getting a little dirty.  This program is designed for childre
 n ages 6 - 9 years old.  Designated Ages – Please adhere to the age re
 strictions designated on your registration. Only children in that age rang
 e will be admitted.   Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, 
 June 10th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesda
 y\, June 17th for residents of other municipalities.Drop Off Program –
  This program is intended for children over the age of 6 years who can p
 articipate independently. Adult(s) must be present to check in child with 
 youth services staff prior to program. Adults will not be allowed in the e
 vent space.  *For children ages 6–7\, this is a drop-off program\; h
 owever\, a parent or caregiver must remain in the library for the durati
 on of the program. Library Program Policies No Show – Patrons failing 
 to cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs in a month w
 ill be restricted from registering for future programs for a period of one
  month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior t
 o the start of the program to allow those on the waiting list to be notifi
 ed of their change in registration status. Late Arrivals – Please arri
 ve 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parking a
 nd other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated 
 time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list
  who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed i
 nto the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter 
 the program 5 minutes past the start time. Photography - The Manheim Towns
 hip Public Library Code of Conduct Policy prohibits photographing or video
  recording individuals (including children) without their consent (or in t
 he case of a child\, the consent of a parent or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Patio
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/kids-garden-club-177381
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
