DESCRIPTION:Children\n\nIn this hands-on program series junior archaeologi
 sts will investigate ancient civilizations\, uncover hidden artifacts and 
 learn how archaeologists discover clues about the past through fun activit
 ies and crafts. In this session we’ll explore the world of Lost Cities\,
  like Pompeii and Troy\, uncovering places that have been hidden for hundr
 eds or even thousands of years. Young archaeologists will discover artifac
 ts\, investigate mysterious discoveries and learn how entire cities were b
 uried and rediscovered through time! Ages 6-9.
