  variety of Tabletop Role Playing Games that rotate each month. No experie
 nce in any system is required and anyone interested in dipping their toes 
 into the TTRPG world are welcomed and encouraged to join in on the fun!Aug
 ust's game is: FIST (Freelance Infantry Strike Team)\, a paranormal mercen
 ary roleplaying game by Claymore Roleplaying Games.You belong to a legenda
 ry rogue mercenary unit called FIST. You are a soldier of fortune who does
 n’t fit into mainstream society. You are one of the little guys\, caught
  up in the death and destruction of pointless proxy wars and oppressive es
 tablishments. You may also be someone who can turn into a ghost or control
  bees with your mind. The paranormal secrets of the Cold War are your brea
 d and butter\, and you fight for your life to make ends meet alongside oth
 ers like you. Registration is required.
