UID:1413d1c1e1b7b79d8956ea50e6333248@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Book Club\, Adults\, Seniors\n\n🏒 HE MADE A MISTAKE... NOW 
 HE HAS TO GROVEL. ⛸️We are heading back to Briar U! Join us at the lib
 rary for our next book club meeting as we dive into The Mistake\, the seco
 nd book in Elle Kennedy's beloved Off-Campus series! 📚✨This time\, we
 ’re talking about Logan and Grace. He messed up\, she walked away\, and 
 now he’s got to pull out all the stops to win her back. 😭❤️Whethe
 r you love a good redemption arc\, second-chance tropes\, or just want to 
 hang out with the Briar hockey crew again\, we want to see you there! 🙌
 What to expect: 🍿 Great snacks 🎲 Fun trivia & discussion 🗣️ Lot
 s of debate on whether Logan groveled enough!Pick up a physical copy at th
 e library\, or download the eBook/eAudiobook on the Libby app! 🏆📖
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Study Room #119
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/mtpl-reads-mistake-elle-
 kennedy-193034
