DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nMeet the Author: Gideon Cop
 e & The Squirrel Who Was Scared of HeightsJoin us for a special story time
  with young\, local author Gideon Cope! Gideon will share his delightful b
 ook\, The Squirrel Who Was Scared of Heights\, alongside his puppet friend
  Albert—the lovable star of the story.An outgoing and animated kid\, Gid
 eon turned a simple idea into a dream come true by becoming a published au
 thor. Come listen to the story\, meet Albert\, and discover what inspired 
