DESCRIPTION:Community\, Presentation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nAdults 18+Join 
 us for a Jewish Dessert tasting and cultural presentation. Come learn abou
 t the history of Russ & Daughters\, a Brooklyn appetizing shop that began 
 in 1914. Taste a bite of various Jewish desserts from Russ & Daughters and
  discover their origins and meaning. This program is part of a grant made 
