 study hall with potluck food and soft drinks. Write Now Lancaster is space
 \, time\, and community\; the writers do the work.Walk-ins are welcome!
LOCATION:Lancaster\, LPL Community Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/write-now-lancaster-1565
 91
