  will be restricted from registering for future programs for a period of o
 ne month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior
  to the start of the program to allow for those on the waiting list to be 
 notified of their change in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please a
 rrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parking an
 d other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated t
 ime. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list 
