X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Amtshows": "https://amtshows.com/show/celtic-thunder-2026/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:amtshows
X-SOURCE:American Music Theatre
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260912T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260912T193000
DTSTAMP:20260520T183744Z
CREATED:20260306T143013Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260520T183744Z
UID:10001852-1789241400-1789241400@amtshows.com
SUMMARY:An Evening with Celtic Thunder: Celebrate Your Favorite Songs
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $64 $74 $84 \nCeltic Thunder returns with an electrifying celebration of Irish music\, storytelling\, and powerful vocal harmony. Known around the world for their dynamic stage productions and charismatic performers\, Celtic Thunder blends traditional Irish songs with contemporary favorites\, delivering a concert experience that is both uplifting and unforgettable. \nBacked by a talented band and enhanced with dramatic lighting and theatrical staging\, the group’s acclaimed vocalists bring passion and personality to every performance. From rousing anthems and beloved ballads to lively folk tunes\, each song showcases the rich musical heritage of Ireland while adding a modern energy that has captivated audiences worldwide. \nWith multi-platinum albums\, sold-out tours\, and millions of fans across the globe\, Celtic Thunder continues to thrill audiences with their signature mix of powerful vocals\, humor\, and heartfelt performances. Join them for an evening filled with stirring music\, Irish spirit\, and pure entertainment. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/celtic-thunder-2026/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Hwy East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17605\, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebrity Concerts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://amtshows.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/CT_Concessions-Events-and-News-for-Website-1920x1080-2.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancasterbirdclub": "https://lancasterbirdclub.org/event/beginner-birder-trip-at-east-lampeter-township-community-park/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancasterbirdclub
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Bird Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260913T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260913T180000
DTSTAMP:20260721T235903Z
CREATED:20250829T165148Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260721T235903Z
UID:2295-1789315200-1789322400@lancasterbirdclub.org
SUMMARY:Beginner Birder Trip at East Lampeter Township Community Park
DESCRIPTION:Sarah Gotwols will lead an afternoon fall migration beginner birder walk at East Lampeter Township Community Park \n\nCelebrate the beauty of fall and the magic of migration with us on a beginner birding program at East Lampeter Township Community Park! Led by an expert from the Lancaster County Bird Club\, this walk is perfect for all ages—whether you’re just getting started or want to sharpen your birding skills.\n\n\n\n When: Sunday\, September 13\, 4–6 p.m.\n Where: East Lampeter Township Community Park (meet at the Lions Pavilion)\n Register to attend: https://eastlampetertownship.org/departments/parks/#birdwalk\n\nLearn how to use binoculars\, field guides\, and birding apps—and keep your eyes peeled for a variety of resident and migrating birds on their fall journey. Please bring binoculars if you have them; a limited number will be available to borrow.\n\n\n In case of bad weather\, cancellations will be announced the day before and registered participants will be notified.\n\n\n\nPresented in partnership with the Lancaster County Bird Club and East Lampeter Township Recreation.
URL:https://lancasterbirdclub.org/event/beginner-birder-trip-at-east-lampeter-township-community-park/
LOCATION:PA
CATEGORIES:Beginner Birder Trips
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lancasterbirdclub.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/IMG_0572.jpeg
END:VEVENT
