UID:7f06cf500b96030a23042892f058abb2@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Presentation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nElaine Potts\, 
 LCSW will speak on The Unrecognized Parts of Grief: The Hidden Weight of S
 econdary Losses.  The death of a loved one dear to us can be challenging i
 n so many ways\, yet what often goes unnoticed by others is the cascade of
  additional losses that can ripple through our lives and add to the comple
 xity of our grief.
LOCATION:Lititz\, LTZ Community Room
