DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, Community\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nThe Blanketeer
 s meet on the 1st and 3rd Tuesday of each month. They get together to soci
 alize and create blankets of various kinds for Project Linus. Project Linu
 s is a volunteer non-profit organization that created handmade blankets to
  give to children who are seriously ill\, traumatized or otherwise in need
  of new handmade blankets. Project Linus welcomes blankets in all styles\,
  including quilts\, tied comforters\, fleece blankets\, crocheted and knit
 ted afghans. No registration needed. For more information contact dguscott
 @lititzlibrary.org or call 717-626-2255.
LOCATION:Lititz\, LTZ Community Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/blanketeers-152103
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
