X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/creating-my-wellness-plan-191739"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Creating My Wellness Plan
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260916T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260916T193000
UID:444682f2a44a3a4b19396535e0522902@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Discussion\, Teens\n\nTeens are invited on a journey to create
  a personalized Wellness Recovery Action Plan (WRAP). WRAP is an evidence-
 based\, interactive\, psycho-educational course where teens will explore s
 tressors\, early warning signs\, crisis planning and developing their own 
 wellness toolbox. Meals will be provided between 5:30 - 6PMActivities star
 ting at 6PMThis six-week program will be led by Licensed Clinical Social W
 orker\, Janae Allgire and Master's Level Social Worker\, Ashlee Rineer. Se
 ssion One: Intro to WrapSession Two: Wellness ToolboxSession Three: My Dai
 ly PlanSession Four: StressorsSession Five: Early Warning Signs & When Thi
 ngs Break DownSession Six: Crisis & Post-CrisisConsistent attendance is re
 commended but not strictly required.Space is limited · Registration is re
 quiredAges 14-18This series is made possible by the LGBTQ+ Giving Circle &
  All Seasons Wellness LLC.
LOCATION:Lancaster\, LPL Meeting and Media Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/creating-my-wellness-pla
 n-191739
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
