BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/parachute-play-169423"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Parachute Play
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260918T101500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260918T104500
UID:b77892e473c41fdcf10ef30d147bb071@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nJoin us for a cooperative m
 ovement program where we will use our imaginations while we play with a pa
 rachute! Stories and songs will be incorporated\, while we move about and 
 use our motor skills. A great activity for young children and their adults
  to come together and share an exciting and engaging play experience! (For
  safety reasons\, children must not be younger than 18 months or older tha
 n 3 years old with an adult\, adult involvement is required)Adults attendi
 ng with their child(ren) do NOT need to register. Please add any additiona
 l registrants to your registration if more than one child that will be par
 ticipating in the program.Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, 
 September 2nd for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Frid
 ay\, September 4th for residents of other municipalities.Storytime Policie
 sNo Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 
 library programs in a month will be restricted from registering for future
  programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrat
 ions at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for those
  on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registration status
 .Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the prog
 ram to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin p
 romptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited
  to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, re
 gistrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not 
 be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Accompanyi
 ng Adults – This program is for adults and children to enjoy together. P
 lease plan to attend and be engaged with your child. Drop offs will not be
  permitted.Cancellations- Please check your email prior to departing to ve
 rify that the program has not been cancelled.Program Limits - Patrons are 
 limited to one session of multiple session programs per week.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/parachute-play-169423
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/dramatic-play-friday-169341"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Dramatic Play Friday
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260918T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260918T154500
UID:f53a8c5af1d235b120d9af5d945f9243@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Toddlers\, Children\n\nDrop-in program. No registration requir
 ed.Join us for a fun-filled adventure at the library! Children ages 2–7 
 are invited to explore their creativity and imagination through hands-on p
 retend play. This free program offers three exciting stations:Post Office:
  Dress up like a mail carrier\, sort mail\, and deliver letters and packag
 es just like a real mail carrier!Veterinary Office: Care for stuffed anima
 l patients as a vet\, complete with checkups and bandages.Diner: Serve up 
 delicious imaginary meals as a chef or take orders as a friendly server.Wi
 th plenty of props\, costumes\, and open-ended activities\, your child can
  explore new roles\, practice social skills\, and have a blast.  No regist
 ration is required—just drop in and play!Each family group must include 
 a responsible adult in the room at all times. This program is for children
  2 to 7 years old only! While other ages are welcome in the room\, we kind
 ly ask that the play area and toys remain reserved exclusively for the int
 ended age group to ensure a safe environment for young participants.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/dramatic-play-friday-169
 341
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
