BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/dungeons-and-dragons-adventure-club-teens-ages-13-18-only-187942"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Tabletop Adventure Club for Teens (Ages 13-18 only)
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260922T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260922T190000
UID:b39f046ea7cb700c7dab99474b46c3ca@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Teens\n\nCalling all teen adventurers ages 13 - 18! J
 oin us for an exciting journey into a world of fantasy\, where your imagin
 ation sets the course. Together\, we’ll learn how to create unique chara
 cters\, navigate magical lands\, and solve thrilling quests. No prior expe
 rience is needed—new and experienced players alike are welcome!In each s
 ession\, you'll explore stories full of mystery\, monsters\, and more all 
 while working as a team to overcome challenges and puzzles. Whether you're
  a brave warrior\, a clever wizard\, or a sneaky rogue\, there’s always 
 an adventure waiting. Are you ready to roll the dice and discover where th
 e story leads?Spaces are limited\, so sign up today to secure your spot in
  our grand adventure! All materials will be provided.Registration will ope
 n at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 15th for Manheim Township and East Lampete
 r residents and on Wednesday\, July 22nd for residents of other municipali
 ties.LIBRARY PROGRAM POLICIES:Drop Off Program – This program is intende
 d for children over the age of 13 years who can participate independently.
  Adult(s) must be present to check in child with youth services staff prio
 r to program. Adults will not be allowed in the event space. Designated Ag
 es – Please adhere to the age restrictions designated on your registrati
 on. Only children in that age range will be admitted.Registration Requirem
 ents – To help us manage our space\, please register every person who wi
 ll be attending\, including siblings.No Show – Patrons failing to cancel
  their registration for more than 2 library programs in a month will be re
 stricted from registering for future programs for a period of one month’
 s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the sta
 rt of the program to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of
  their change in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 mi
 nutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parking and other cir
 cumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At thi
 s time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be
  granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the prog
 ram. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 mi
 nutes past the start time.Cancellations- Please check your email prior to 
 departing to verify that the program has not been cancelled.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center B
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/dungeons-and-dragons-adv
 enture-club-teens-ages-13-18-only-187942
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
