DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, Community\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nThe Sensory So
 cial is getting a low-key summer remix! Drop in for a relaxing hour of col
 oring\, lo-fi beats\, and calm lighting.This is a self-guided\, community-
 wide lounge where everyone is welcome to relax\, keep their hands busy\, a
 nd create at their own pace. Our space is intentionally designed to be sen
 sory-friendly\, fully accessible\, and inclusive for all adults\, includin
 g individuals with IDD\, autism\, and their support people.We provide a va
 riety of intricate coloring pages\, high-quality markers\, and pens\, but 
 feel free to bring your own favorite supplies if you prefer! Come as you a
 re\, bring a friend\, and just zone out and chill.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center B
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/color-chill-180047
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
