DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Babies\n\nBook Babies is a special time for babies
  to share stories\, songs\, rhymes and games with their grown-ups. Come pl
 ay with us in the Children’s Library! (Newborn to 17 months\, with adult
 ) Please add any additional registrants to your registration if more than 
 one child that will be participating in the program.Registration for Book 
 Babies will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, September 9th for Manheim Townsh
 ip and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, September 11th for resident
 s of other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesProgram Limits - Patrons are l
 imited to one session of multiple session programs per week.Cancellations-
  Please check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has
  not been cancelled.No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registrati
 on for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from reg
 istering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please ca
 ncel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program
  to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in 
 registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to th
 e start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The p
 rogram will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spo
 t will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. I
 f spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, re
 gistrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the st
 art time.
