BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Amtshows": "https://amtshows.com/show/itzhak-perlman-with-rohan-de-silva-piano/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:amtshows
X-SOURCE:American Music Theatre
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261003T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261003T193000
DTSTAMP:20260520T184807Z
CREATED:20260427T133021Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260520T184807Z
UID:10001880-1791055800-1791055800@amtshows.com
SUMMARY:Itzhak Perlman with Rohan De Silva\, Piano
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $99 $129 $149 $169 \nRenowned as one of the greatest violinists of all time\, Itzhak Perlman brings extraordinary artistry\, warmth\, and joy to audiences around the world. A true icon of classical music\, Perlman has performed with every major orchestra and in the world’s most celebrated concert halls\, earning 16 GRAMMY® Awards\, multiple Emmy Awards\, a Kennedy Center Honor\, and the Presidential Medal of Freedom. \nIn addition to his celebrated orchestral appearances\, Perlman continues to captivate audiences through special programs and intimate recitals alongside longtime collaborator Rohan De Silva. A passionate advocate for music education\, he and his wife Toby founded the Perlman Music Program\, helping to mentor and inspire the next generation of musicians. \nWhether performing beloved classics or exploring new works\, Perlman’s unmatched musicianship and enduring passion make every performance an unforgettable experience. \nAcclaimed pianist Rohan De Silva is widely recognized as one of the leading collaborative artists of his generation. Known for his sensitivity\, precision\, and expressive depth\, De Silva has performed on the world’s most prestigious stages alongside many of today’s greatest instrumentalists. \nA longtime collaborator of Itzhak Perlman\, De Silva brings a refined musical partnership that enhances every performance with nuance and balance. His artistry has been praised for its elegance and versatility\, seamlessly supporting and elevating the soloist while shining in his own right. \nTogether\, De Silva and Perlman create an extraordinary concert experience\, blending technical mastery with heartfelt musical connection. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/itzhak-perlman-with-rohan-de-silva-piano/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Hwy East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17605\, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebrity Concerts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://amtshows.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/IP_Concessions-Events-and-News-for-Website-1920x1080-2.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Amtshows": "https://amtshows.com/show/diamond-rio-2026/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:amtshows
X-SOURCE:American Music Theatre
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261004T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261004T190000
DTSTAMP:20260520T184907Z
CREATED:20260504T133057Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260520T184907Z
UID:10001882-1791140400-1791140400@amtshows.com
SUMMARY:Diamond Rio
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $39 $49 $59 $69 \nCountry music trailblazers Diamond Rio have been delivering chart-topping hits and signature harmonies for decades. Formed in the late 1980s\, the band made history with their debut single “Meet in the Middle\,” becoming the first country group ever to reach No. 1 with a debut release. They quickly followed with a string of hits\, including “How Your Love Makes Me Feel\,” “One More Day\,” “Beautiful Mess\,” “Unbelievable\,” and “I Believe\,” earning a reputation for their rich vocals and exceptional musicianship. \nWith more than 6.8 million albums sold\, over a billion global streams\, and an impressive run of 20 Top 10 singles\, Diamond Rio has remained a constant force in country music. Known for playing every note on their recordings\, the band’s artistry extends beyond radio hits to acclaimed instrumental performances and genre-spanning projects\, including their Grammy Award-winning Christian album\, The Reason. \nA member of the Grand Ole Opry and recipient of multiple CMA\, ACM\, and Grammy honors\, Diamond Rio continues to captivate audiences with their timeless sound and energetic live performances. Don’t miss your chance to experience one of country music’s most celebrated groups live in concert. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/diamond-rio-2026/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Hwy East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17605\, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebrity Concerts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://amtshows.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/DR_Concessions-Events-and-News-for-Website-1920x1080-2.jpg
END:VEVENT
