  to your registration if more than one child that will be participating in
  the program.Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, September 30t
 h for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, October
  2nd for residents of other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesNo Show – P
 atrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 library progra
