UID:001ea820daa219a6ceeabc1984f4c1c2@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\n\nA time for Toddlers with their grown-u
 p\, dedicated to stories\, discovery and exploring!  (18 months to 36 mont
 hs\, with adult. Other family members welcome.)Adults attending with their
  child(ren) do NOT need to register. Please add any additional registrants
  to your registration if more than one child that will be participating in
  the program.Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, October 7th f
 or Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, October 9t
 h for residents of other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesNo Show – Patr
 ons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs 
 in a month will be restricted from registering for future programs for a p
 eriod of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 h
 ours prior to the start of the program to allow for those on the waiting l
 ist to be notified of their change in registration status.Late Arrivals 
 – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow fo
 r parking and other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the 
 designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on th
 e wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may b
 e allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to
  enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Accompanying Adults – T
 his program is for adults and children to enjoy together. Please plan to a
 ttend and be engaged with your child. Drop offs will not be permitted.Canc
 ellations- Please check your email prior to departing to verify that the p
 rogram has not been cancelled.Program Limits - Patrons are limited to one 
 session of multiple session programs per week.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/toddler-time-169485
